      "side": 1,
      "message": "Stripping fullLine from column 0 instead of colOffset regresses from lean-diff-util.ts when a closed multi-line block comment or multi-line attribute ends on the same line as a scoping directive like \"open ... in\" or \"set_option ... in\". If anything before colOffset on that closing line opens a line comment or string literal (such as a multi-line attribute closing a string before \"] open Nat in theorem bad : False :\u003d by sorry\"), stripLeanCommentsAndStrings blanks the rest of the line, so findStandaloneInEnd returns -1 and swallows the trailing declaration into the directive. Caching cachedStrippedStartCol alongside cachedStrippedRow and stripping from colOffset on cache miss preserves O(N) runtime, eliminates bomShift (currently unexercised by bomEveryLine), and restores parity; please also add a regression test for this case.",
